            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to crosslinkers having at least two benzophenone substituents that are covalently coupled to a benzophenone linker. The present invention further relates to compositions comprising at least one polymer and at least one crosslinker according to the present invention. The present invention also relates to medical products and medical supplies having a coating of crosslinked polymers and at least one crosslinker of the present invention, but also relates to cosmetical and hygienical products including at least one crosslinker according to the present invention.</p>
